  "review": [
    "Egyptian Arabic colloquial; rendered in liturgical Hebrew with second-person address. Rom 8:35 register in the title/1:1 (מִי יַפְרִידֵנִי). فدى → פָּדָה, نفس → נֶפֶשׁ per glossary. 2:1 \"engraved on Your palm\" (Isa 49:16); 3:1 \"because You are alive, I shall live like You\". No chorus."
  ]
